{"id":51631,"date":"2026-06-11T15:46:48","date_gmt":"2026-06-11T14:46:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51631"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:29:17","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:29:17","slug":"grande-premio-museu-nacional-ferroviario","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-museu-nacional-ferroviario\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Pr\u00e9mio Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>XXIX Grande Pr\u00e9mio Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no <strong>Entroncamento<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o emblem\u00e1tica da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal do Entroncamento<\/strong> com o apoio t\u00e9cnico do <strong>CLAC &#8211; Clube de Lazer, Aventura e Competi\u00e7\u00e3o do Entroncamento<\/strong>, que celebra a heran\u00e7a e a paix\u00e3o ferrovi\u00e1ria da cidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partida \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do prestigiado <strong>Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio (Rua Ferreira de Mesquita)<\/strong>, o evento oferece uma <strong>Corrida de Estrada de 10 km<\/strong> com tra\u00e7ado citadino r\u00e1pido e plano, bem como a <strong>11.\u00aa Caminhada Cidade Ferrovi\u00e1ria \u2013 Jos\u00e9 Canelo de 7 km<\/strong>, com uma taxa simb\u00f3lica de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o de 2,00 \u20ac que inclui t-shirt oficial, abastecimentos e cronometragem.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio (Rua Ferreira de Mesquita), Entroncamento, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida de Estrada) e 7 km (Caminhada Jos\u00e9 Canelo)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal do Entroncamento \/ CLAC Entroncamento<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2h00<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10K (XXIX GP Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 2.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13 Set com t-shirt)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">11.\u00aa Caminhada Jos\u00e9 Canelo 7K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Geral:<\/strong> 2.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (com t-shirt at\u00e9 13 Set)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Menores 12 Anos:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (sem t-shirt)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o XXIX Grande Pr\u00e9mio Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova decorre no domingo, 20 de setembro de 2026, com partida e meta \u00e0s 10:00 junto ao Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio, no Entroncamento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento conta com a Corrida de 10 km em estrada e a 11.\u00aa Caminhada Cidade Ferrovi\u00e1ria \u2013 Jos\u00e9 Canelo com 7 km de extens\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o valor da taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem um custo simb\u00f3lico de apenas 2,00 \u20ac (gratuita para menores de 12 anos na caminhada) e inclui t-shirt oficial, dorsal, seguro e abastecimentos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 a altimetria e o piso do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso de 10 km \u00e9 integralmente disputado em asfalto pelas avenidas do Entroncamento, sendo muito plano e prop\u00edcio \u00e0 obten\u00e7\u00e3o de recordes pessoais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde podem ser feitas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma QueroIr.pt ou presencialmente na sede do CLAC no Entroncamento at\u00e9 13 de setembro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Grande Pr\u00e9mio Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Museu Nacional Ferrovi\u00e1rio (Rua Ferreira de Mesquita)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Entroncamento\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\":